.md\\t56\\t403\\tSTR\\t573 U.S. 373, 403\\t573 U.S. 373\\nconverted\\tHeien v. North Carolina\\tcontent/seizures/Traffic Stops.md\\t34\\t61\\tAT\\t574 U.S. at 61\\t574 U.S. 54\\nconverted\\tHeien v. North Carolina\\tcontent/seizures/Traffic Stops.md\\t129\\t61\\tPINNOTE\\t574 U.S. 54, 61\\t574 U.S. 54\\nconverted\\tMesserschmidt v. Millender\\tcontent/the-warrant/getting-a-warrant/Franks Challenges.md\\t43\\t547\\tSTR\\t565 U.S. 535, 547\\t565 U.S. 535\\nconverted\\tMesserschmidt v. Millender\\tcontent/the-warrant/getting-a-warrant/Franks Challenges.md\\t90\\t547\\tPINNOTE\\t565 U.S. 535, 547\\t565 U.S. 535\\nconverted\\tMesserschmidt v. Millender\\tcontent/use-of-force-and-liability/Qualified Immunity.md\\t41\\t547\\tSTR\\t565 U.S. 535, 547\\t565 U.S. 535\\nconverted\\tMissouri v. McNeely\\tcontent/warrant-exceptions/home-entry-and-search/Destruction of Evidence.md\\t35\\t156\\tSTR\\t569 U.S. 141, 156\\t569 U.S. 141\\nconverted\\tMissouri v. McNeely\\tcontent/warrant-exceptions/home-entry-and-search/Destruction of Evidence.md\\t103\\t156\\tPINNOTE\\t569 U.S. 141, 156\\t569 U.S. 141\\nconverted\\tMissouri v. McNeely\\tcontent/warrant-exceptions/searching-a-person/SIA Alcohol Tests.md\\t29\\t156\\tSTR\\t569 U.S. 141, 156\\t569 U.S. 141\\nconverted\\tMissouri v. McNeely\\tcontent/warrant-exceptions/searching-a-person/SIA Alcohol Tests.md\\t78\\t156\\tPINNOTE\\t569 U.S. 141, 156\\t569 U.S. 141\\nconverted\\tRiley v. California\\tcontent/warrant-exceptions/searching-a-person/SIA Cell Phones.md\\t18\\t403\\tSTR\\t573 U.S. 373, 403\\t573 U.S. 373\\nconverted\\tRiley v. California\\tcontent/warrant-exceptions/searching-a-person/SIA Cell Phones.md\\t25\\t387\\tAT\\t573 U.S. at 387\\t573 U.S. 373\\nconverted\\tRiley v. California\\tcontent/warrant-exceptions/searching-a-person/SIA Cell Phones.md\\t27\\t387\\tAT\\t573 U.S. at 387\\t573 U.S. 373\\nconverted\\tRiley v. California\\tcontent/warrant-exceptions/searching-a-person/SIA Cell Phones.md\\t40\\t387\\tAT\\t573 U.S. at 38